  "question": {
    "text": "If $a, b, c$ are in G.P. $(a>1, b>1, c>1)$, then for any real number $x($ with $x>0, x \\neq 1), \\log _{\\mathrm{a}} x, \\log _{\\mathrm{b}} x, \\log _{\\mathrm{c}} x$ are in",
