  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $a, b, c$ are in G.P.\n$\\Rightarrow \\log _x a, \\log _x b, \\log _x c$ are in A.P.\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{\\log _x a}, \\frac{1}{\\log _x b}, \\frac{1}{\\log _x c}$ arein H.P.\n$\\Rightarrow \\log _a X, \\log _b X, \\log _c X$ are in H.P.",
